For more information on the Ad Supply Forecasts API, check out Ad Supply Forecasts.
Suggested Targeting Options
The LinkedIn Ads platform allows you to reach a wide range of audiences based on unique targeting criteria. The Ad Targeting Similar Entities finder suggests additional targeting attributes based on a provided target set.
Sample Request
The following example returns industries similar to Biotechnology, urn:li:industry:12.

https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adTargetingEntities?q=similarEntities&facet=urn:li:adTargetingFacet:industries&entityType=INDUSTRY&entities=urn:li:industry:12&fields=value,name,facetUrn,urn

curl -X GET 'https://api.linkedin.com/rest/adTargetingEntities?q=similarEntities&facet=urn:li:adTargetingFacet:industries&entityType=INDUSTRY&entities=urn:li:industry:12&fields=value,name,facetUrn,urn' \
-H 'Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}'

Sample Response
{
  "elements": [
    {
      "value": {
        "string": "urn:li:industry:15",
        "string~": {
          "name": {
            "localized": {
              "en_US": "Pharmaceuticals"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "string": "urn:li:industry:17",
        "string~": {
          "name": {
            "localized": {
              "en_US": "Medical Device"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "value": {
