If you are an API partner integrating with the Reporting APIs, please review the Integration Requirements to understand the capabilities you need to build and demonstrate during the Technical Sign Off process.
Social Actions
Shares may have social actions such as likes and comments attached to them. With the socialActions API, you can view social actions on various types of network updates. To learn more about retrieving social actions, see Network Update Social Action.

GET https://api.linkedin.com/rest/socialActions/{share URN}/comments

curl -X GET 'https://api.linkedin.com/rest/socialActions/{share URN}/comments' \
-H 'Authorization: Bearer {INSERT_TOKEN}'

Sample Response
{
    "elements": [
        {
            "created": {
                "time": 1485303622383
            },
            "id": "6229814924525211648",
